  "reasoning_content": "The user wants me to continue writing the scientific review article, specifically Chapter 7 (Methodological Challenges and Future Research Directions). I need to follow the approved outline and write the content for the tasks assigned to Chapter 7.\n\nLooking at the tasks for Chapter 7:\n- Ch7_U01: Technical standardization and methodological challenges (P01-P04)\n- Ch7_U02: Causal inference limitations and confounding (P01-P04)\n- Ch7_U03: Clinical trial evidence gaps and population representation (P01-P04)\n- Ch7_U04: Future directions - multi-omics, AI, advanced models, precision intervention (P01-P04)\n\nI need to write natural scientific prose that builds on the previous chapters (Ch1-Ch6) which have already been written. The previous chapters established:\n- Ch1: Clinical associations across cancer types\n- Ch2: Immunological mechanisms\n- Ch3: Metabolite mediation\n- Ch4: External factors (antibiotics, PPIs, diet)\n- Ch5: Clinical intervention trials (FMT, probiotics)\n- Ch6: Toxicity associations\n\nNow Ch7 needs to synthesize the methodological challenges and future directions based on all the evidence presented in previous chapters.\n\nLet me start writing Chapter 7 content, following the approved outline and using the provided evidence materials appropriately. I need to ensure I don't repeat content from previous chapters but build on them to discuss methodological challenges and future directions.\n\nI'll write in Chinese as the article is in Chinese, following the scientific prose style established in previous chapters.",
